                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#10eee7' fontname='Segoe UI Semibold' fontsize='15'>Project Overview</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Segoe UI Semibold'>MedTrack DV is an interactive healthcare analytics dashboard designed to monitor hospital performance, patient flow, department efficiency, and resource utilization. It transforms raw hospital data into meaningful visual insights through interactive dashboards and key performance indicators (KPIs).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Segoe UI Semibold'>The solution enables hospital administrators and healthcare professionals to analyze admissions, occupancy, patient movement, billing, and clinical performance, supporting faster, data-driven decision-making and improved operational efficiency.</run>
